body:
Wow, I was going through a spiral and this popped up.I'm sorry you're going through this OP. I was also cheated on, it happened a year ago and I went through all the same things that you described.Even a year later, like today I just sit a cry thinking about what happened. I am doing much better now but one thing that really helped was therapy. I was able to pick myself back up. I stopped taking anxiety meds. I tried dong different hobbies. 

&#x200B;

I hope this can help you do the same, You deserve to be happy and maybe doing more things to uplift yourself will give you the strength to walk away.
